  "text": "i want to give you a free one-on-one consulting session with me a free one-on-one call with me to discuss whatever you want however i can help you improve your business and i'm going to talk about that at the end of this video but the big thing i want to announce is i launched the passion products show it's my brand new podcast and on it i'm going to be doing a few different really interesting things i'm going to be first off interviewing a lot of the most successful passion product sellers that i know or that i'm trying to find these are people that have done millions of dollars on kickstarter these are people that are making millions of dollars off their own passion products on and off amazon i'm also going to be interviewing some of the top amazon sellers in the world as well as a lot of the students from my course the passion product formula i'm going to be interviewing them and documenting their journey i'm going to be sharing with you live as they work on their business as they try to grow it the struggles the ups and the downs all the different people that are in my course i'm going to be sharing with you their entire journey i'm also gonna be sharing with you a lot of insights into my life and just different things going on but basically this is gonna be a podcast where i share all my amazon techniques all the different tips tactics that i'm learning from some of the top amazon sellers top people selling passion products as well as showcasing all my students in fact i already recorded five episodes and i've launched it on youtube apple podcast spotify stitcher all those different things i'll put links up here and down below if you want to see the first five episodes and one of the episodes in particular i actually have my mom come on and my mom was my first business partner ever we launched a company called bee dancewear which was a dance clothing company it's my first company not a company i was passionate about and i share in there some really like deep personal things that i haven't talked about on this channel before some of the struggles that i went through when i first quit my corporate job some things that are really kind of like hard to share and on top of that my mom shares how she felt during this time because i think i freaked her out a little bit when i first you know i quit my corporate job they didn't think that it was a good idea for me to quit and you get to see a different perspective on my entrepreneur journey on the story and struggle that was my early entrepreneurial career and on top of that in that episode i talk about some of the early days of my first company the bee dancer the dance clothing company and something i don't talk often on this channel is the first three four five years that i was an entrepreneur that i was doing e-commerce full-time after i'd quit my corporate job i was working on this business it was a big struggle and i don't talk about it often because it's kind of painful and i do talk about it in that episode now if you do want to get a free 101 consulting session with me go to apple podcast itunes stitcher wherever you listen to your podcast preferably apple podcast or itunes so if you have an iphone just pull up podcast app and leave a five star review for the podcast every month i'm going to be picking someone at random to give a one-on-one consulting session to for free so the earlier you leave a review the more chances you have to win so please go to itunes or apple podcast and leave that five-star review because first off you'll get a chance to win that one-on-one consulting session and on top of that it really helps me out and it really helps the show and the more reviews that we can get on the show the more five star reviews the higher quality guests we can get on and i'm looking to get some of the top ecommerce sellers in the world on this show so go to itunes or apple podcast for that chance to win free 101 consulting session with me make sure to subscribe on your podcast app and start listening to the episodes and give me some feedback of what you think about the podcast episodes in the comments down below and if you do want to watch the podcast on youtube you can click on this video right here it links to the brand new channel i started where i share all the different episodes so click on that video leave your review in itunes or apple podcast and thank you again so much for watching and thank you for your support",
